<p align="center">&nbsp;</p>

<p><font face="Arial" color="#800000" size="2">Please use this form to join the
&quot;Paintings and Arts Stamps Internet Club - PASIC&quot;. Please read the <a href="../PASIC/statutes-en.htm"><i>Statutes</i></a>
before to apply for membership. <i>Don't fear to be flooded by unsolicited mail
after having published your e-mail information, because the e-mail addresses
cannot be automatically taken over from the members' list.</i></font></p>

<p><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">Some Tips</font></p>

<ul>
  <li><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2"><i>Full Name</i>: please fill in your first name and then your last
    name, using the right capitalization, like &quot;<span style="background-color: #FFFF00">Victor Manta</span>&quot;, </font><font color="#FF0000" face="Arial" size="2">not</font><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">
    like
    &quot;victor manta&quot;, </font><font color="#FF0000" face="Arial" size="2">not</font><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">
    like VICTOR MANTA and </font><font color="#FF0000" face="Arial" size="2">not</font><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">
    like &quot;Manta Victor&quot;.</font></li>
  <li><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2"><i>Languages</i>:<br>
    - New. You can introduce only one language. </font><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2"> If possible
    choose a
    language that many people speak on the Internet, like English.&nbsp;</font></li>
  <li><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">Special interests: Please try to be brief. Example:
    Ital.
    Paintings, 19th Century, instead of Italian Paintings of the 19th Century.</font></li>
  <li><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">If you have made a <i>mistake</i>,
    send me an <a href="mailto:manvic_99spaam@yahoo.com"><i>e-mail</i></a> and I'll
    correct the wrong data.</font></li>
  <li><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">Please <span style="background-color: #FFFF00">click
    only one time</span> the &quot;Join PASIC&quot; button. Thank you a lot! In
    order to verify the result, load the Members List in a new instance of the
    browser (launch it again, because if not, you'll read the old version from
    your computer's cache).</font></li>
</ul>
  </center>
                <p align="right">&nbsp;</td>
  <center>
              <td><p><font face="Arial" size="2" color="#800000">Veuillez
                utiliser ce formulaire pour rejoindre le &quot;Paintings and Arts Stamps Internet Club - PASIC&quot;.
                Lisez s.v.p. les <a href="../PASIC/statutes-fr.htm"><i>Statutes</i></a>.</font></p>

  <p><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">Quelques conseils</font></p>
                <ul>
                  <li><font face="Arial" color="#800000" size="2">Prénom et nom: svp. completez d'abord votre prénom et
